## Third-Party Components (NOT bundled)

This repository contains **no third-party binaries**. `install.py` downloads the
following packages from their upstream release pages at the user's request. They
are not distributed by this project.

| Package | License | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `omni_xpu_kernel` | Apache-2.0 | [wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU](https://github.com/wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU) |
| `comfy_kitchen_xpu_runtime` | Apache-2.0 (inherited from `comfy-kitchen`) | [wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU](https://github.com/wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU) |
| `comfy_aimdo_xpu_runtime` | **GPL-3.0** (inherited from `comfy-aimdo`) | [wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU](https://github.com/wildersa/ComfyUI-Intel-Arc-XPU) |
| `comfy-aimdo` | **GPL-3.0** | [Comfy-Org/comfy-aimdo](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/comfy-aimdo) |
| `comfy-kitchen` | Apache-2.0 | [Comfy-Org/comfy-kitchen](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/comfy-kitchen) |
| ComfyUI | **GPL-3.0** | [Comfy-Org/ComfyUI](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI) |

Note: ComfyUI itself is GPL-3.0, and `comfy-aimdo` is a required dependency of
ComfyUI 0.45.x. Running this workflow does not trigger any GPL obligation —
GPL requires source disclosure only when you *distribute* the software.
